# Typography and language support.
# The interface font itself ships in ros-fonts, which is built from this
# repository; what is listed here is the fallback coverage behind it, because
# Funnel Display covers Latin and Cyrillic only.
#
# ROS targets English / French / Kinyarwanda institutions, so the fallback
# stack has to cover Latin-extended well and the locale list is generated at
# build time.
locales
fonts-cantarell
fonts-noto-core
fonts-noto-color-emoji
fonts-liberation2
fonts-dejavu
hunspell-en-us
hunspell-fr
